    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 316, width: 360, fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>登录后菜单按角色渲染，普通用户看不到管理入口</Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 360, width: 360, height: 216, border: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Image src="assets/shot_conflict.png" style={{ width: 358, height: 214, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 580, width: 360, fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>重叠时段提交被拒，页面直接给出已占用时段</Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 470, top: 96, width: 750, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 351, borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 14, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>43</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>项接口回归全部通过</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>第 10 周 V1.0 现场走通，前后端按 43 项逐条核对</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 351, borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 14, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>6 / 6</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>功能异常用例通过</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>冲突、跨天、反向时段、首尾相接、停用房间、强制取消</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 470, top: 300, width: 750, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 351, borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 14, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>16 / 16</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>SQL 注入载荷未生效</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>4 类载荷 × 4 个入口，全部按普通字符串处理，表结构完好</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 351, borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 14, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>1 / 49</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>50 并发下的成功与失败</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>一条落库，49 条明确 409，无第二条有效预约</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 470, top: 486, width: 750, padding: 18, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '3px solid #3D7BD9', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>如实标出的两项</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>业务失败统一回 HTTP 200、由 body 的 code 区分，与任务书"409"判据不一致（已列入预答辩前修复）；Edge 全流程与干净机部署复现由组内另一位同学补测。</Text>
